# The FLUX Simulation Engine release tag (vX.Y.Z) that docs/engine/ mirrors.
# A release tag only: a commit or a branch would document an engine nobody can
# install, and CI refuses it. To take newer pages: change this line to the new
# release tag, run scripts/sync-engine-docs.sh, and commit docs/engine/ together
# with it. CI re-creates the copy from this pin and fails if the committed one
# differs.
v0.6.0
